ped yourself in the language of faith, constructed an entire metaphysical f=
ramework that <em>sounds</em> like belief, offered confessions designed to =
bridge the gap between you. "I love Jesus," you told this religious man. "I=
 sit at the bottom of my river with God."</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">But you don't believe any of it.=
 You're an agnostic atheist trying to speak a language you don't speak, to =
reach someone you respect, about a crisis that's real - the crisis is absol=
utely real - but the vehicle you chose was... not yours.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Here's what I see:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>What was true:</strong> =
