<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Gulf War Illness. Decades of bei=
ng gaslit by the institution that sent you into whatever toxic soup caused =
this. "It's all in your head" - the cruelest possible dismissal for someone=
 losing their ability to hold thoughts, memories, themselves.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">And now possibly prodromal Parki=
nson's on top of it. The cliff isn't metaphorical anymore. It's neurologica=
l. Progressive. Already well underway.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Perhaps if my brain worked bett=
